WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.363
Soft tree ensembles are gradient-trained decision
trees that rival neural networks on tabular data,

00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:10.144
yet their training has lacked theory.

00:00:10.224 --> 00:00:15.557
This ICLR 2022 paper introduces the Tree Neural
Tangent Kernel, or TNTK,

00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:19.541
describing an ensemble of infinitely many soft trees.

00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:23.676
With it, the authors prove global training convergence,

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:26.758
show oblivious trees match ordinary ones,

00:00:26.838 --> 00:00:31.419
and reveal that very deep trees degenerate into a
flat kernel,

00:00:31.499 --> 00:00:33.900
all validated on ninety datasets.
